  "emailBody": "\n        <html>\n\n        <body\n            style=\"\n                font-family:Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;\n                margin:20px;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    background:#d42e12;\n                    color:white;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                \"\n            >\n\n\n               <h1 style=\"margin:0;\">\n                    Fuel Market Intelligence Afternoon Report\n                </h1>\n\n                <p style=\"margin:5px 0 0 0;\">\n                    17 August 2026\n                </p>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <p\n                style=\"\n                    font-size:16px;\n                    margin-top:20px;\n                    margin-bottom:20px;\n                \"\n            >\n                Good afternoon Sir,\n                <br><br>\n                \n                Here is today's fuel market intelligence report highlighting\n                the latest PMS and AGO depot prices together with key industry\n                developments and market news.\n            </p>\n\n            <br>\n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            PMS Prices\n        </h2>\n\n        <div\n            style=\"\n                background:#fad5a1;\n                padding:12px;\n                border-left:5px solid #f28e05;\n                margin-bottom:10px;\n                font-size:16px;\n                font-weight:bold;\n            \"\n        >\n            Average PMS Prices: ₦1,174.69/L\n        </div>\n\n        <table\n            width=\"100%\"\n            cellspacing=\"0\"\n            cellpadding=\"10\"\n            style=\"\n                border-collapse:collapse;\n                border:1px solid #ddd;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <tr style=\"background:#d42e12;color:white;\">\n                <th align=\"left\">Depot</th>\n                <th align=\"left\">Price</th>\n            </tr>\n\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>PINNACLE</td>\n                <td>₦1,167.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DANGOTE</td>\n                <td>₦1,165.50</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>NORTHWEST</td>\n                <td>₦1,180.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>MAINLAND</td>\n                <td>₦1,180.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>SOBAZ</td>\n                <td>₦1,180.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>FYNEFIELD</td>\n                <td>₦1,180.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>NIPCO LAGOS</td>\n                <td>₦1,170.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>AITEO</td>\n                <td>₦1,175.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            AGO Prices\n        </h2>\n\n        <div\n            style=\"\n                background:#fad5a1;\n                padding:12px;\n                border-left:5px solid #f28e05;\n                margin-bottom:10px;\n                font-size:16px;\n                font-weight:bold;\n            \"\n        >\n            Average AGO Prices: ₦1,658.50/L\n        </div>\n\n        <table\n            width=\"100%\"\n            cellspacing=\"0\"\n            cellpadding=\"10\"\n            style=\"\n                border-collapse:collapse;\n                border:1px solid #ddd;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <tr style=\"background:#d42e12;color:white;\">\n                <th align=\"left\">Depot</th>\n                <th align=\"left\">Price</th>\n            </tr>\n\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DANGOTE</td>\n                <td>₦1,593.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>PINNACLE</td>\n                <td>₦1,625.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DUPORT</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>AFRICAN TERMINAL</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>IBETO</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>RAINOIL LAGOS</td>\n                <td>₦1,680.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>A.Y.M SHAFA</td>\n                <td>₦1,720.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>FYNEFIELD</td>\n                <td>₦1,700.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            Market News\n        </h2>\n        \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Strait of Hormuz Tanker Traffic Slumps as U.S.-Iran Faceoff Lingers\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Only five commodity vessels crossed the strategic waterway on Saturday, while no crossings were scheduled for Sunday. The figures compare with 31 tanker crossings recorded over the previous weekend. Despite the sharp decline in visible tanker traffic, crude prices have remained below their earlier highs.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/strait-of-hormuz-tanker-traffic-slumps-as-us-iran-faceoff-lingers\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Why Oil Prices Aren’t Rising Despite the Strait of Hormuz Crisis\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Oil prices have remained relatively subdued despite the prolonged disruption around the Strait of Hormuz. Brent crude was trading around $88.52 a barrel on Friday, down 1.7 percent since the start of August. The International Energy Agency has significantly lowered its outlook for global oil demand this year.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/why-oil-prices-arent-rising-despite-the-strait-of-hormuz-crisis\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    FG Launches Crude Trading Platform to Boost Refinery Supply\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    The Federal Government has introduced an automated crude oil trading platform designed to connect crude producers, regulators, refineries and oil marketers in a single marketplace. The platform will allow participants to conduct live transactions and coordinate crude allocation, pricing, sales and delivery.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/fg-launches-crude-trading-platform-to-boost-refinery-supply\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Iran Bars U.S. Forces From Hormuz, Offers $30,000 Bounty for Soldiers\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Iran has declared that US forces will no longer be permitted to operate in the Persian Gulf, the Gulf of Oman, or the Strait of Hormuz. Iranian Army Commander Major General Amir Hatami made the statements on Sunday. Hatami said the expulsion of US forces from the region had already taken place.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/iran-bars-us-forces-from-hormuz-offers-30000-bounty-for-soldiers\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Dangote Refinery Exports 476,000MT of Refined Products in Nine Cargoes for August\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Dangote Petroleum Refinery exported 476,000 metric tonnes (MT) of refined petroleum products in nine cargoes in August. August export programme covered Fuel Oil, Jet A1, automotive gas oil (AGO) and premium motor spirit (PMS) The largest cargo was the 144,000MT Fuel Oil shipment aboard Nordic Breeze.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/dangote-refinery-exports-476000mt-of-refined-products-in-nine-cargoes-for-august\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n\n        </body>\n\n        </html>\n        "
